    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·12月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"a765ec0cf1ff9aa5e2f1d3958e1d2695\" title=\"12月前瞻.png\" alt=\"12月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241025/a765ec0cf1ff9aa5e2f1d3958e1d2695.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"706855fe59207230f1e998e6ecb8b2ff\" title=\"12月月小队.png\" alt=\"12月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241025/706855fe59207230f1e998e6ecb8b2ff.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者逻各斯</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">跨越死与生的桥梁。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"83ad5deb6d73f0e2ba79ab9a857b09e2\" title=\"12月奖励.png\" alt=\"12月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241025/83ad5deb6d73f0e2ba79ab9a857b09e2.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">125</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>12月稀有奖励主题可交互家具封闭的通路</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">浸染禁忌巫术的造物。连接往日未来的通路。魂灵窥探故事的诡术。通向众我意识的坦途<span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">。</span></span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>12月稀有奖励泥岩形象时装</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">敲开拦路桎梏。移走堆积障碍。即使褪下厚重铠甲。也没人能阻断土石之子的前路。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
